Sure, here's a basic HTML template for a webpage. Feel free to modify it to fit your needs:

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>My Webpage</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
        }
        header {
            background-color: #333;
            color: white;
            padding: 10px 0;
            text-align: center;
        }
        main {
            padding: 20px;
        }
        footer {
            background-color: #333;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 10px 0;
            position: fixed;
            width: 100%;
            bottom: 0;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <h1>My Webpage</h1>
    </header>
    <main>
        <p>This is the main content of the webpage.</p>
    </main>
    <footer>
        <p>Copyright © 2023 My Webpage. All rights reserved.</p>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
```

This template includes a header with a blue background and white text, a main content area with a white background and padding, and a footer with a blue background and white text. You can customize the content and styling to better suit your needs.
